ENCODE CTCF peak download provenance
=====================================
Download date: 2026-07-18
Portal: https://www.encodeproject.org

Experiment accession : ENCSR000DZN
  assay_title        : TF ChIP-seq
  target             : CTCF
  biosample          : GM12878 (EBV-transformed B-lymphoblastoid cell line)
  status             : released

File accession       : ENCFF796WRU
  file_format        : bed narrowPeak
  output_type        : conservative IDR thresholded peaks
  assembly           : GRCh38 (hg38)
  status             : released
  href               : /files/ENCFF796WRU/@@download/ENCFF796WRU.bed.gz
  saved to           : inputs/encode/ENCFF796WRU.bed.gz

Sanity checks
  n peaks            : 44217
  chrom set          : chr1..chr22, chrX (no chrY; GM12878 is female) -- all hg38 primary autosomes + chrX
  interval type      : narrowPeak, point-ish (median width ~ a few hundred bp)

Notes
  The experiment also carries an "optimal IDR thresholded peaks" file (ENCFF960ZGP).
  Per iteration19 CLAUDE.md we use the CONSERVATIVE IDR-thresholded set (ENCFF796WRU)
  as the single primary CTCF peak call. One cell type (GM12878) per request; kept
  swappable via a CLI arg in the analysis scripts.

