SECOND CELL TYPE added 2026-07-18 (naive/resting CD4 T cell)
=====================================
Experiment accession : ENCSR470KCE
  assay_title        : TF ChIP-seq
  target             : CTCF
  biosample          : Homo sapiens CD4-positive, alpha-beta T cell, male adult (20 years)
                       -- primary RESTING/UNSTIMULATED CD4 T cell. NOTE: ENCODE has no
                       experiment explicitly labelled "naive CD4"; this resting primary
                       CD4+ ab T cell is the closest match (its "activated CD4" counterpart
                       is the separate experiment ENCSR806WWX).
  status             : released

File accession       : ENCFF858TLX
  file_format        : bed narrowPeak
  output_type        : IDR thresholded peaks   (the experiment carries a single IDR
                       thresholded set; analogous to the conservative/optimal IDR call)
  assembly           : GRCh38 (hg38)
  status             : released
  saved to           : inputs/encode/ENCFF858TLX.bed.gz

Sanity checks
  n peaks            : 40346
  chrom set          : chr1..chr22, chrX, chrY (male donor -> chrY present)

Cross-cell-type note
  For direct comparability with the GM12878 baseline the analysed locus set is kept
  identical (the single chrY locus HSFY1/HSFY2 remains excluded even though this male
  CD4 sample has chrY signal). Windows are cell-type-independent and reused verbatim.

