E2G reproducibility panel 2026-07-18 (5 additional lymphoid cell types)
=====================================
All ATAC-based ENCODE-rE2G thresholded element-gene links (extended model, GRCh38),
saved under inputs/encode/e2g_panel/. Analysed with scripts 07 (per set) + 08 (aggregate).
  memory CD4 T cell : annotation ENCSR167VBG -> file ENCFF440AKC  (T cell)
  CD8 T cell        : annotation ENCSR701WTT -> file ENCFF993UOE  (T cell)
  Jurkat (T-ALL)    : annotation ENCSR094ORE -> file ENCFF705FWU  (T-lineage cell line)
  NK cell           : annotation ENCSR090RIY -> file ENCFF359ZSL  (lymphoid control, non-T)
  B cell            : annotation ENCSR414ISQ -> file ENCFF186ABX  (lymphoid control, non-T)
NOTE: ENCODE's ATAC-based rE2G resource contains only 3 T-cell subtypes beyond the Treg
baseline (memory CD4, CD8, Jurkat); NK and B cell added as lymphoid controls to complete a
5-set panel and test generalization. Download date 2026-07-18; portal encodeproject.org.
